Package: pubchroma
Title: Journal-Inspired Color Palettes for Scientific Figures
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("tyuan2024", email = "tyuan2024@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides color palettes inspired by major scientific journals
    (Nature, Science, Cell, NEJM, Lancet, JAMA, PNAS, BMJ) for use in
    biomedical and engineering figures. Includes colorblind-safety checking
    and integration with ggplot2.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    yaml
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/tyuan2024/pubchroma
BugReports: https://github.com/tyuan2024/pubchroma/issues
